{"title":"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_MOP_2024\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by MOP 2024</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/5/c45a9440a903bd7c6cff6b0be3105608f3cd9e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/65262bf247c4a3c6114a8223d249dc9702619d3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> be integers. Suppose that the product of the solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> of the equation\n</p><p><br />\t\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/19555089c6b0a7647279aa6d4dd6068be044d7e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8(\\log_n x)(\\log_m x)-7\\log_n x-6 \\log_m x-2013 = 0\\]\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\t\nis the smallest possible integer. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><br /> \t\t \t\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cf8b056666aaaf8c30bff139d40f333f3bf37f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 12\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 20\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 24\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 48\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 272$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"403\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\t\n</p><p><br />\t\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearranging logs, the original equation becomes\n</p><p><br />\t\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/f/3df6ef64bacddd85e8c6a3ba01b31c94058d9d4d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{8}{\\log n \\log m}(\\log x)^2 - \\left(\\frac{7}{\\log n}+\\frac{6}{\\log m}\\right)\\log x - 2013 = 0\\]\" width=\"433\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><br />\t\n</p><p><br />\t\nBy Vieta's Theorem, the sum of the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7dfc10dcbc5b23e7c667b2cdbea104715ff654a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/114330833b4fd99deddc3ef2acb4bbb881d14a26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{7}{\\log n}+\\frac{6}{\\log m}}{\\frac{8}{\\log n \\log m}} = \\frac{7\\log m + 6 \\log n}{8} = \\log \\sqrt[8]{m^7n^6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"356\" height=\"51\" />. But the sum of the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7dfc10dcbc5b23e7c667b2cdbea104715ff654a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"16\" /> is the logarithm of the product of the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Thus the product of the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/a/f1a1a942f13056ed570065e4481a68bc9ecaa395.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[8]{m^7n^6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\t\n</p><p><br />\t\nIt remains to minimize the integer value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/a/f1a1a942f13056ed570065e4481a68bc9ecaa395.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[8]{m^7n^6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/c/c9cb5659cebbd2675f49f9e7851ba16421af79d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, we can check that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e490227c1cb265179d33111c80c551d1bc218f9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2^2$\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/2/5b2713a52d0dfdf12081e959330f1395e3c0130b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2^3$\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> work. Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e982cde4bde64a784fe576ea824dc5773b6d04a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\t\n</p><p><br />\t\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For those who prefer a video solution: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vX0y9lRv9OM&amp;t=312s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vX0y9lRv9OM&amp;t=312s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_by_MOP_2024\">Video Solution 2 by MOP 2024</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 by MOP 2024\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/n5RfHdh3HTk\">https://youtu.be/n5RfHdh3HTk</a>\n</p><p>~r00tsOfUnity\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B\">2013 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017231929\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 191/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3460/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.171      1 -total\n 58.57%    8.300      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 38.54%    5.462      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11813:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017231929 and revision id 197488. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}